---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Joe Saia"
  description="Personal blog and reflections from Joe Saia on technology, AI, management, effective giving, and modern education."
>
  <section class="space-y-8">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">
        Joe Saia
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-heading sm:text-5xl">
        Joe Saia
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
      <p>
        I am a technologist who is always optimistic about the power of
        technology to change the world for the better, but I know this does not
        happen automatically.
      </p>
      <p>
        I have a PhD in Economics. The best job I ever had was working as a
        research assistant at the Federal Reserve because I got to work with
        smart, hard-working public servants who took their responsibility
        seriously.
      </p>
      <p>
        For the past five years I have been in health-tech startups leading
        engineering organizations, while continuing to think deeply about how we
        maximize our impact on the world.
      </p>
      <p>
        I use this site as a personal blog for my own reflections and as a way
        to force myself into structured thinking.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you would like to discuss ideas around technology, AI, management,
        effective giving, or modern education, please reach out.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
      <a
        href="/writing/"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded bg-btn-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-text-heading transition-colors hover:bg-btn-bg-hover"
      >
        Read the Blog
      </a>
      <a
        href="/contact/"
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded border border-border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:border-border-hover"
      >
        Get in Touch
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
